{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Mark 9:33-37 | Jesus Redefines Greatness Around Servanthood And Welcome\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Mark 9:38-41 | Jesus Corrects Possessive Ministry\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Mark 9:42-48 | Jesus Warns Against Harming Little Ones And Tolerating Sin\
